      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "•Immaculate three-bedroom home extending to approx. 166 sq.m/ 1,786 sq.ft\n•Accommodation comprises of hallway, guest w.c., kitchen/dining area, family room, playroom/office, three bedrooms, study/dressing room, en-suite and family bathroom\n•Situated on the grounds of Knockanally House, this property enjoys the picturesque communal grounds surrounding the village \n•Attractive red brick and render front with cobble lock path. This property boasts fine interior features including high ceilings, under floor heating (downstairs), insulation plumbed external walls, bay windows, wood burning stove and newly installed French door & balcony \n•Excellent transport links with Rail available from Kilcock (9.4km) and Enfield (9.1km), within 6.5km from Exit 9 on the M4 motorway, Dublin is within a 40-minute drive and only 17km from Maynooth\n\n\nGuide Price\n390,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Hallway 5.70m x 1.70m \nTiled flooring, attractive timber mouldings, cloak rack and hanging area, hardwood/glazed doors leading to principal accommodation.\n\nGuest W.C. 1.77m x 194m\nTiled flooring, part-tiled walls W.C. and wash hand basin, blind.\n\nKitchen/Dining 4.10m x 6.70m\nTiled flooring, fully fitted kitchen with ample storage, built-in oven and grill, electric hob, extractor fan, stainless steel sink, integrated dishwasher, integrated fridge freezer, tiled splashback, additional electrical sockets, blinds, double doors providing access to the communal grounds.\n\nUtility Room 1.88m x 2.62m\nTiled flooring, plumbed for washing machine, additional fitted storage cabinets, access to communal grounds, conveniently accessible from both the hallway and kitchen.\n\nUnderstairs Storage\nUseful additional storage.\n\nLiving Room 7.17m x 3.96m\nCarpeted flooring, feature natural stove fireplace with marble surround, decorative feature chimney breast/wall, door providing access to communal grounds, additional sockets.\n\nOffice / Playroom 2.75m x 4.43m\nCarpeted flooring, feature floor-to-ceiling window, attractive views over the surrounding landscape, hardwood/glazed double doors. \n\nLanding 2.19m x 4.46m\nCarpeted staircase with hardwood handrail and balustrade, timber wall mouldings, feature window, Hot-press.\nBedroom 1 3.55m x 4.00m\nCarpeted flooring, fitted wardrobes, integrated vanity/desk, TV point, additional electrical sockets.\n\nBedroom 2 4.00m x 3.30m\nCarpeted flooring, fitted wardrobes, integrated vanity/desk, TV point, additional sockets.\n\nBathroom 3.00m x 2.13m\nTiled floor, bath, w.c., wash hand basin, integrated mirror, shaving light.\n\nMaster Bedroom 3.92 x 7.17m\nSpacious master bedroom with carpeted flooring, French doors opening onto a semi-circular balcony (both newly installed), attractive views over the surrounding grounds.\n\nEnsuite 2.31m x 2.85m\nTiled floor, w.c., wash hand basin, shower enclosure, mirror.\n\nWalk-In Wardrobe/Dressing Room/Study 2.96m x 4.00m\nCarpeted flooring, fitted wardrobes, integrated shelving, feature window overlooking the countryside.\n\nAdditional Information:\nBuilt in 2005\nSolid pine internal doors, with selected doors incorporating glazed panels\nTimber mouldings and decorative detailing\nGenerous ceiling heights\nManagement fees approx. 900 including bins\nDesignated Parking and guest parking \nNew Balcony (2024) & French Doors leading to balcony (2023)\nAttic Floored and insulated with access via folding Stira ladder \nExternal walls plumbed with insulation\n\nItems Included in sale:\nFixtures and fittings.\n\nServices:\nFibre broadband \nMains water\nElectric underfloor heating downstairs\nSeptic tank Communally share) \n\nBER\nC\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W91 TK82\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nJill Wright \n01 6286128\njillw@coonan.com\n\n"
      },
